: Enchanting Armour and Weapons:

:   I had a +7 or +8 Athame on a Wizard and I read one more blessed Enchant 
:     Weapon and it shuttered and dissapeared... After this I noticed I had an
:     extra few points of strength (from 18/03 - 18/12) -- This also happened
:     to my +5 shield when I read a uncursed Enchant Armour -- What happens
:     to these items?

	Weapons/armor can't withstand very high magical enchantments --
 they vaporize when you try to enchant them beyond +6. There's a way to
 get a +7 enchantment though: a blessed scroll of enchant whatever on a
 +5 thing.

: Alignments and Gods:

:   Can I switch a non-aligned alter to my Gods alignment?

	Keep offering on a non-aligned altar, eventually you'll convert
 it.

: Wormtooth:

:   What do I do with a blessed Wormtooth?

	A scroll of enchant weapon turns it into a crysknife, which used
 to be the best weapon there was in Hack 1.03, but nowadays you have
 those artifact weapons and such. Remember not to drop it!

